    "text": "By OLIVIA WALLACE ,\n4 hours ago The No.16 Bearcat football (6-1, 5-0 MIAA) team is set to face off with yet another MIAA foe, the University of Nebraska-Kearney Lopers (5-3, 3-3 MIAA), for the highly anticipated Homecoming game. The team is coming off a huge 53-2 win against the Fort Hays State University Tigers Oct. 18... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
